## Super Yankee vs Lucky 31, Yankee, and Other Multiple Bets
A super yankee calculator helps bettors compare this 26-bet combination with related multiple bet types. The Super Yankee requires 5 selections generating 26 bets (10 doubles, 10 trebles, 5 four-folds, 1 five-fold), positioning it between the simpler Yankee (4 selections, 11 bets) and the more comprehensive Lucky 31 (5 selections, 31 bets including singles). Understanding these differences helps players select the system matching their confidence level and budget.
| Bet Type | Selections | Total Bets | Includes Singles | Minimum Winners for Return |
